    },
    "「未確認」のフレンドは以前のバージョンで登録されたため、名前が本人のものか確認できていません。相手から依頼を受け取ると確認済みになります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Unverified” friends were added by an earlier version, so their names haven’t been verified. They become verified when you receive a request from them."
