    "You have %lld places, but iOS can watch only 20. %lld won't send alerts: received requests are watched first, and your oldest memos drop off first. Complete or delete some memos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "場所が %1$lld 件あります。iOS が監視できるのは 20 件までで、%2$lld 件は通知されません。受信した依頼が優先され、自分のメモは古いものから外れます。メモを完了にするか削除してください。"
